{"t":"Akananto (NPC)","s":"akananto-npc-9855b","k":"npc","i":"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_7_10ea82.png","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"messagebox deprecatedbox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Block Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Block_Icon_f2bbea.png\" width=\"50\"/></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure><p style=\"font-weight: bold;\">This article or section is deprecated.</p><br/><p>The information on this page is no longer relevant to the Tibia or TibiaWiki community. It may have been removed from the game or made inaccessible.</p><p style=\"font-style:italic;font-size:x-small;\">The information in this page or section may not be accurate anymore, but this page should be retained for posterity.</p><p style=\"line-height:6pt;font-size:6pt;width:100%;text-align:right;\">discuss</p></div><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Akananto (NPC)</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geographical Properties</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThais\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Nearest City</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Map</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"posx\"><center><div class=\"map_image\" style=\"width:150px;display:inline-block;position: relative;\"><img alt=\"75?cb=20260713145837&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_7_10ea82.png\"/><div style=\"border-right: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 100%;width: 50.6%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div><div style=\"border-bottom: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 50%;width: 100%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"minimap_clic\" style=\"width:152px;display:block;text-align:right;font-size:14px\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32268,32030,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (32268, 32030, 7)</a></div></center></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Personal Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"gender\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gender</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Male</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"job\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Job</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Rebel</div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">9.44<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">January 13, 2012</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Deprecated.</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: NPCs <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20230831010827&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Akananto_NPC_b2c319.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"npc-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see Akananto.</div></div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-twbox-bubble\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NPC Bubble D\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NPC_Bubble_D_215d07.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Yarr!</li><li>Ha! You still cannot kill me!</li><li>That blood over there, is that yours? Harr harr!</li><li>I don't see any ninjas here, do you?</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>North in <a href=\"#/wiki/Greenshore\">Greenshore</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Could only be seen during the celebration of <a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia%27s%2015th%20Anniversary\">Tibia's 15th Anniversary</a>.<br/>\nWhen you say <b>fun</b> to Akananto, he will summon <a href=\"#/wiki/Pirates\">Pirates</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Apes\">Apes</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20%28Goblin%29\">Demons (Goblins)</a>. He will only summon creatures once per hour.<br/>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" style=\"width: 180px\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\">  <img alt=\"Tibia's_15th_Anniversary!_Akananto's_raids!\" class=\"\" data-video-key=\"Tibia's_15th_Anniversary!_Akananto's_raids!\" data-video-name=\"Tibia's 15th Anniversary! Akananto's raids!\" height=\"101\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tibia_s_15th_Anniversary_Akananto_s_raids_512898.png\" width=\"180\"/> <span class=\"thumbnail-play-icon-container\"> <svg aria-label=\"Play\" class=\"thumbnail-play-icon wds-icon\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-player-icon-play\"></use></svg> </span>  <figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> <svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg> <p class=\"title\">Tibia's 15th Anniversary! Akananto's raids!</p> <p class=\"caption\">Video showing Akananto's raids</p> </figcaption> </figure>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for Akananto (NPC).</i></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p><i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\nAkananto: Ahoy, <i>Player</i>!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>name</b><br/>\nAkananto: My name is Akananto and I'm your most favourite pirate.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>job</b><br/>\nAkananto: I'm observing whether everything is working. And whether there are any pools of blood on the ground here. I'm sort of responsible for both, harr harr!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>how are you</b><br/>\nAkananto: I'm having fun. As usual.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>ninja</b><br/>\nAkananto: I do not see any ninja around here, do you?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>pirate</b><br/>\nAkananto: YARR! 'Nuff said.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>greenshore</b><br/>\nAkananto: Greenshore is the mooring place of the mighty Tibianic and a lovely, calm place in general - except when I am there. Harr harr!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>fun</b><br/>\nAkananto: Are you sure you're prepared for my kind of fun? I need to finish some pirate business first.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>business</b><br/>\nAkananto: There is no business like pirate business.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>dragon</b><br/>\nAkananto: You'll never forget my first dozen of dragons.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>demon</b><br/>\nAkananto: One can have a lot of fun with demons. Especially when you are invincible yourself. Harr harr!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>dog</b><br/>\nAkananto: Don't dare to call me a dog! I'm a pirate now.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>arr</b><br/>\nAkananto: It's 'yarr'. Not 'arr' or 'harr'. 'Harr' is only used in 'harr harr'. Usually ninjas mix that up all the time. Nasty little ninjas. Luckily there are none here right now.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Tokel\">Tokel</a></b><br/>\nAkananto: Tokel, that guy over there, must have nerves of steel: no matter what happens to his hometown, nothing is going to prevent him from selling snacks. Nothing. Not even demons. Been there, done that, didn't work.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>time</b><br/>\nAkananto: <i>(current time)</i> it is.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>help</b><br/>\nAkananto: Your asking the wrong person, sorry.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>free itens</b><br/>\nAkananto: No, I don't give away free items today. Not even low level armors of the elfs.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>bye</b><br/>\nAkananto: Have fun!</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Akananto (NPC)</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":[],"pos":{"x":32268,"y":32030,"z":7}}